    "catalog:note": "Downflow computer-room air handler: supply air leaves through the collar under the unit into the floor void, return air enters the collar on the back. Air-side ports carry the 600 hall module as their nominal section. Coil section behind, filter section and door in front, chilled-water stubs on the front. Ports, dimensions and ids are the seed's, unchanged.",
